' View of proposed AppSec Agent Harness; see study for scope and correspondence.
@startuml appsec-lifecycle
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/behavioral/statemachine-diagram-style.iuml

title AppSec investigation - V5 lifecycle
state Received
state Normalized
state Investigating
state "Awaiting review" as Review
state "Approved intent" as Approved
state Verifying
state "Review outcome recorded" as Recorded
state Escalated
state Cancelled
[*] --> Received
Received --> Normalized : validate / redact
Received --> Escalated : invalid event
Normalized --> Investigating : scope established
Investigating --> Review : evidence or abstention
Investigating --> Escalated : budget exhausted or failure
Review --> Recorded : human triage disposition
Review --> Approved : authorized remediation intent
Approved --> Verifying : current approval / dispatch
Approved --> Review : stale or revoked approval
Verifying --> Review : candidate and independent receipts
Verifying --> Escalated : failed checks / budget exhausted
Investigating --> Cancelled : cancel
Review --> Cancelled : cancel
Approved --> Cancelled : revoke
Verifying --> Cancelled : stop and reconcile
Recorded --> [*]
Escalated --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Recorded
  Records review outcome only.
  Source alert closure is a separate
  human-authorized operation.
end note
@enduml
